OL,3,GNEWSARise in people waiting for NHS
OL,4,Atreatment for fourth month in a row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of people waiting for
OL,7,Ftreatment by the NHS in Wales has risen
OL,8,Ffor the fourth consecutive month,
OL,9,Faccording to new statistics.
OL,11,FThe figures show there were just under
OL,12,F709,700 cases waiting for planned
OL,13,Ftreatments in July.
OL,15,FOf these, just over 4,700 had been
OL,16,Fwaiting two years or more - a 15% rise
OL,17,Fover the course of a month and 82%
OL,18,Fhigher than the position at the end
OL,19,FMarch.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
