OL,3,GNEWSARise in people waiting for NHS
OL,4,Atreatment for fourth month in a row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government's health minister
OL,7,Fhas described the figures as
OL,8,Fdisappointing with performance "not
OL,9,Fwhere we want it to be".
